t seems to me that israel  has gone too far and israel has pushed  two red lines which would make it a a a  hard for hamas to convince the islamic  jihad to stop firing rockets against  israel i think it's going to take  countries like qatar or egypt or the  yuan to try to intervene and mediate an  immediate ceasefire between the islamic  jihad and israel
 

